Third-party code
----------------
firmware/bus_parse/bus_parse.ino contains frame-parsing, CRC and type-map code ported from
the AMCU-v2 firmware in Bambu-Research-Group/Bambu-Bus
(https://github.com/Bambu-Research-Group/Bambu-Bus), which is licensed under GPL-3.0
(AMCU by 4016N and the Bambu-Bus contributors). It was modified by heavydms in 2026:
adapted to two UARTs as a transparent bridge, 16-bit long-frame lengths, change tracking,
logging, the buffer tap and the sync marker.

Protocol facts (baud rate, frame layout, CRC parameters, message types) are cited in
README.md with their sources.
